# Rope's effects follow the Equipment (CR 301.5c, 613.4c, 509.1b): equipped to Memnite on turn 1 it makes it a 2/3 with reach that two creatures cannot block; moved on turn 3 for Equip {3} to
# the other Memnite, the first is a plain 1/1 again that two creatures may block, and the second is the one limited to a single blocker. Bot1's four Moxen pay {G} and Equip {3} each turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Rope
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Memnite
Memnite
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Island x17

